Description: MCP server for Noark 5 tjenestegrensesnitt API
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that provides tools for browsing,
 searching, and managing archive entities through the Noark 5 REST API.
 .
 Supports authentication via Basic auth, HATEOAS endpoint discovery, CRUD
 operations on all major entity types, and OData search/filter across
 collections.
